  "description": "Oblique, our gravel adventure model is a comfortable and maneuverable bike for your rides on and beyond road. Quickly escape the tarmac and explore the unknown. The frame is made from light weight high strength select Columbus steel tubes, which gives this bike the most essential characteristics – compliance, long life, and unique comfort. The T47 bottom bracket ensure ideal energy transfer. We custom developed the flat-mount. The shaped rear stays and forks can take tire clearance up to 700×45c, we think anything larger is MTB territory. More comfortable stack/reach 1.55 geometry allows you to spend an entire day in the saddle with ease. Shorter reach, slacker headtube, compact stem, wider handlebar, chainstay of 430mm and a BB drop of 80mm all keeps the Obliques stable and balanced when you hit the rutted dirt roads. The Columbus carbon fork with mount/eyelets for bikepacking, incorporates a 47/52 multi-rake system to keep the trail dimensions under control.",
